        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hey @echasnovski,\r\n\r\nI think because I saw the cursor being animated I thought it had to finish before I could type but like you said that's not the case. I can start typing because the cursor position is actually in the correct place even if the animation isn't finished.\r\n\r\nAnd yes I think I can take that and apply it for my use case. Thanks for taking the time out to answer my question and provide the example! I'll close this issue now.",
